  "name": "气泡确认",
  "tags": [
    "弹窗",
    "提示"
  ],
  "summary": "危险操作（删除 / 移出）的轻量二次确认：点按钮后在它上方浮出小气泡「确定删除？」+ 取消 / 删除，箭头指向触发按钮。点空白、Esc、取消都能关闭，不打断当前列表；确认后执行删除。",
  "usage": "列表行、卡片上的删除/移出按钮，操作不可逆或会影响他人时用。一次只确认一个对象，气泡里只放两个动作，点了立刻生效。",
  "caution": "高频普通操作别加二次确认，会拖慢节奏；移动端或按钮贴边时气泡空间不够，改用居中弹窗或底部操作条；批量删除应用弹窗列出清单，并说明能否撤销。",
  "hint": "点「删除」在按钮旁弹出气泡，点「取消」或按 Esc 关闭",
  "prompt": "【气泡确认 Popconfirm】目标：危险操作（删除 / 移出）的轻量二次确认。点按钮后在它上方浮出一个小气泡：「确定删除？」+ 取消 / 删除两个动作，箭头精准指向触发按钮；点空白、Esc、取消都能关掉，确认后才执行删除。\n\n1) 结构：.wrap（position:relative）> .row（列表行）+ .pop（绝对定位气泡）。气泡一行横排：.q 文案 + .cancel 次要按钮 + .ok 危险按钮，.arrow 是 9px 小方块旋转 45° 做成箭头。触发按钮用 --ui-danger 描边 + 9% 底色。\n\n2) 定位：气泡 left = 触发按钮中心 - 气泡宽/2，再 clamp 到 wrap 内；top = 按钮顶 - 气泡高 - 9px。箭头 left = 按钮中心 - 气泡左，贴边夹紧时箭头跟着挪，保证始终指向按钮。气泡常驻 display:flex（只切 opacity / pointer-events），这样 offsetWidth 随时可测，避免 display:none 测不到宽度。\n\n3) 动画：气泡 opacity 0 + translateY(4px) scale(.96) → 归位，0.15 秒 opacity、0.18 秒 cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1) transform。按下反馈：触发按钮和气泡里的按钮 .pressing 时 scale(.95)。\n\n4) 交互：点触发按钮 toggle；点气泡外部关闭（触发按钮和气泡内部 stopPropagation）；Esc 关闭；点「取消」关闭；点「删除」执行删除——演示里行变虚线置灰 + 名字加删除线表示已移出，约 1 秒后复原循环，真实项目里移除整行。窗口 resize 时重算位置。\n\n5) 无障碍：触发按钮 aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" + aria-expanded 跟随开关；气泡 role=\"dialog\" + aria-labelledby 指向文案；按钮用 button。\n\n6) 坑：气泡一定不要在 wrap 外溢（小屏要 clamp 左右）；不要用 display:none 切换气泡（测不到宽度、也没有过渡）；删除确认只能一次确认一个对象。\n\n7) 配色：只用 --ui-*；删除按钮 --ui-danger，确认按钮文字用 var(--ui-bg)；气泡底色 --ui-surface-2 比行背景更亮，箭头边框与描边同色。\n\n8) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；懒创建演示光标；首轮延迟 300 毫秒并读 rect 判空；节奏是光标移到删除按钮 → 0.56 秒后按下 0.19 秒 → 松开并弹出气泡 → 移到「删除」按钮 → 按下执行 → 行变虚线（约 1 秒）→ 复原 → 1.1 秒后下一轮。\n\n9) 使用场景：不可逆或影响他人的删除/移出，一次一个对象；频率高或需列清单的操作改用 Toast + 撤销，或居中弹窗。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}\n\n.wrap{position:relative;width:min(340px,100%)}\n\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:12px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  transition:opacity .24s ease,background .24s ease,border-color .24s ease}\n.row.gone{opacity:.55;background:transparent;border-style:dashed;pointer-events:none}\n.row.gone .meta b{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:var(--ui-danger)}\n.row.gone .del{opacity:.45}\n\n.ava{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;place-items:center;\n  font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-bg);\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 65%,#fff),var(--ui-brand))}\n.meta{flex:1;min-width:0}\n.meta b{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.meta small{display:block;margin-top:1px;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n\n.del{appearance:none;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;cursor:pointer;\n  font:inherit;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;\n  color:var(--ui-danger);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 42%,transparent);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 9%,transparent);\n  transition:transform .12s ease,background .16s ease}\n.del:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 16%,transparent)}\n.del.pressing,.del:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n.del svg{width:11px;height:11px;display:block}\n\n.pop{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;z-index:6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  padding:8px 10px;border-radius:11px;white-space:nowrap;\n  background:var(--ui-surface-2);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:0 12px 32px color-mix(in srgb,#000 20%,transparent);\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px) scale(.96);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .15s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.pop.show{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n.pop .q{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text)}\n.pop button{appearance:none;font:inherit;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;\n  padding:5px 10px;border-radius:7px;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.pop .cancel{border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.pop .cancel:hover{color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-surface)}\n.pop .ok{border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--ui-bg);background:var(--ui-danger)}\n.pop .ok:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}\n.pop button.pressing,.pop button:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n\n.arrow{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:-5px;width:9px;height:9px;margin-left:-4.5px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface-2);border-right:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  transform:rotate(45deg)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:10px}\n  .row{padding:7px 9px;gap:7px;border-radius:10px}\n  .ava{width:24px;height:24px;font-size:10px}\n  .meta b{font-size:11px}\n  .meta small{font-size:9px}\n  .del{font-size:10px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:7px}\n  .pop{padding:6px 8px;gap:6px;border-radius:10px}\n  .pop .q{font-size:10px}\n  .pop button{font-size:10px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:6px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .row,.del,.pop,.pop button{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"row\" id=\"row\">\n    <span class=\"ava\" aria-hidden=\"true\">陈</span>\n    <span class=\"meta\"><b>陈小满</b><small>文档《季度复盘》· 协作者</small></span>\n    <button class=\"del\" id=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pop\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3.4h8M4.6 3.4V2.2h2.8v1.2M3.2 3.4l.5 6.1h4.6l.5-6.1\"/></svg>\n      删除\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pop\" id=\"pop\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"popTitle\">\n    <span class=\"q\" id=\"popTitle\">确定删除？</span>\n    <button class=\"cancel\" id=\"cancel\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n    <button class=\"ok\" id=\"ok\" type=\"button\">删除</button>\n    <span class=\"arrow\" id=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var wrap=document.getElementById('wrap'),\n      row=document.getElementById('row'),\n      del=document.getElementById('del'),\n      pop=document.getElementById('pop'),\n      arrow=document.getElementById('arrow'),\n      cancel=document.getElementById('cancel'),\n      ok=document.getElementById('ok');\n  var openState=false, cursor=null, timers=[];\n\n  function later(fn,ms){ var id=setTimeout(fn,ms); timers.push(id); return id; }\n\n  /* 气泡固定贴着触发按钮上方，箭头对准按钮中心；贴边时夹到视口内并挪箭头 */\n  function place(){\n    var wr=wrap.getBoundingClientRect(), br=del.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!wr.width||!br.width) return false;\n    var pw=pop.offsetWidth, ph=pop.offsetHeight;\n    if(!pw||!ph) return false;\n    var cx=br.left+br.width/2-wr.left;\n    var left=Math.max(6,Math.min(cx-pw/2,wr.width-pw-6));\n    pop.style.left=left+'px';\n    pop.style.top=(br.top-wr.top-ph-9)+'px';\n    arrow.style.left=(cx-left)+'px';\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  function openPop(){\n    if(openState) return;\n    if(!place()) return;\n    openState=true;\n    del.setAttribute('aria-expanded','true');\n    pop.classList.add('show');\n  }\n\n  function closePop(){\n    if(!openState) return;\n    openState=false;\n    del.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');\n    pop.classList.remove('show');\n  }\n\n  del.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    if(openState) closePop(); else openPop();\n  });\n  cancel.addEventListener('click',function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); closePop(); });\n  ok.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    closePop();\n    row.classList.add('gone');\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('click',function(){ closePop(); });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape') closePop(); });\n  window.addEventListener('resize',function(){ if(openState) place(); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return null;\n    if(typeof window.__uiDemoCursor==='function') cursor=window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    var c=ensureCursor();\n    if(!c) return;\n    row.classList.remove('gone');\n    var r=del.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width||!r.height){ later(demo,300); return; }\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(del);\n    later(function(){\n      c.press(); del.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        c.release(); del.classList.remove('pressing');\n        openPop();\n        later(function(){\n          c.moveTo(ok);\n          later(function(){\n            c.press(); ok.classList.add('pressing');\n            later(function(){\n              c.release(); ok.classList.remove('pressing');\n              closePop();\n              row.classList.add('gone');\n              c.hide();\n              later(function(){\n                row.classList.remove('gone');\n                later(demo,1100);\n              },1000);\n            },190);\n          },560);\n        },750);\n      },190);\n    },560);\n  }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive){\n    later(function(){\n      if(wrap.getBoundingClientRect().width) demo();\n      else later(demo,300);\n    },300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
